<section class="pb-125">
  <div class="container container-lg">
    <div class="js-slide-bottom mb-0 row">
      <div class="col">
        <h2 class="mb-0 pb-35 text-quote border-red-pink-dark-bottom colour-red-pink-dark">You may wonder about...</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    
      
      <div class="js-slide-bottom mb-0 row">
        <div class="col">
          <div class="border-red-pink-dark-bottom">
            <a href="#" class="js-accordion-link">
              <div class="position-relative size-full-width">
                <div class="align-left align-top position-absolute pt-25">
                  <img src="/perch/resources/faq4.svg" class="icon-sm js-svg-inject fill-red-pink-dark">
                </div>
                <h3 class="mb-25 pl-4 pr-4 pt-25 text-title colour-red-pink-dark">Is it possible to book the meeting rooms without any personal contact?</h3>
                <div class="align-right align-top position-absolute pr-2 pt-25">
                  <p class="js-accordion-link-text-icon pt-05 text-line-height-0 text-quote text-quote-md text-right colour-red-pink-dark">
                    +
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
            <div class="animated js-accordion-content js-hidden pb-15 pl-4 pr-4 text-helper">
              <p>Yes indeed, we can go totally contactless! We set up the room beforehand based on your requirements &amp; then ensure the proper disinfection. Thanks to the dial locks, key safe and video assistance, you can get into the building &amp; make your event happen without us actually being there.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    
      
      <div class="js-slide-bottom mb-0 row">
        <div class="col">
          <div class="border-red-pink-dark-bottom">
            <a href="#" class="js-accordion-link">
              <div class="position-relative size-full-width">
                <div class="align-left align-top position-absolute pt-25">
                  <img src="/perch/resources/catering.svg" class="icon-sm js-svg-inject fill-red-pink-dark">
                </div>
                <h3 class="mb-25 pl-4 pr-4 pt-25 text-title colour-red-pink-dark">Do you offer catering?</h3>
                <div class="align-right align-top position-absolute pr-2 pt-25">
                  <p class="js-accordion-link-text-icon pt-05 text-line-height-0 text-quote text-quote-md text-right colour-red-pink-dark">
                    +
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
            <div class="animated js-accordion-content js-hidden pb-15 pl-4 pr-4 text-helper">
              <p>We work with reliable, established catering partners. Depending on your needs, we will find the most suitable service provider for you and facilitate direct communication to finalize the details.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    
      
      <div class="js-slide-bottom mb-0 row">
        <div class="col">
          <div class="border-red-pink-dark-bottom">
            <a href="#" class="js-accordion-link">
              <div class="position-relative size-full-width">
                <div class="align-left align-top position-absolute pt-25">
                  <img src="/perch/resources/faq4.svg" class="icon-sm js-svg-inject fill-red-pink-dark">
                </div>
                <h3 class="mb-25 pl-4 pr-4 pt-25 text-title colour-red-pink-dark">What are your booking conditions &amp; cancellation policy?</h3>
                <div class="align-right align-top position-absolute pr-2 pt-25">
                  <p class="js-accordion-link-text-icon pt-05 text-line-height-0 text-quote text-quote-md text-right colour-red-pink-dark">
                    +
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
            <div class="animated js-accordion-content js-hidden pb-15 pl-4 pr-4 text-helper">
              <p>After accepting our price offer, we require an advance payment of 50% of the final price. You can cancel your booking anytime without penalty up until 2 weeks before your event starts &amp; your advance payment will be fully refunded or transferred to another booking. In case of a cancellation within 14 days 50% of the rental fee,  within 7 days 100% of the rental fee needs to be paid. For more info check out our <a href="https://loffice.hu/perch/resources/gtcaszfbpen.pdf">GTC</a>!</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    
      
      <div class="js-slide-bottom mb-0 row">
        <div class="col">
          <div class="border-red-pink-dark-bottom">
            <a href="#" class="js-accordion-link">
