                <div class="align-left align-top position-absolute pt-25">
                  <img src="/perch/resources/faq1.svg" class="icon-sm js-svg-inject fill-red-pink-dark">
                </div>
                <h3 class="mb-25 pl-4 pr-4 pt-25 text-title colour-red-pink-dark">Where can I park if I come to an event?</h3>
                <div class="align-right align-top position-absolute pr-2 pt-25">
                  <p class="js-accordion-link-text-icon pt-05 text-line-height-0 text-quote text-quote-md text-right colour-red-pink-dark">
                    +
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
            <div class="animated js-accordion-content js-hidden pb-15 pl-4 pr-4 text-helper">
              <p>If you plan to arrive by car to attend an event, street parking or the surrounding parking facilities are available. You can lock your bicycle or scooter to the bike racks in the inner courtyard. With prior arrangement, you may also bring them inside the space.</p>
            </div>
